<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate falls to 4.52 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate falls to 4.52 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar dropped to 4.52 percent on Monday from 4.79 percent on Sunday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said five banks traded on the market in 22 reported transactions with a total value of 20.8 million dinars.</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
